On sunnypatel.co.uk, five stats and data pages hold 31 unique referring domains between them, checked on 24 September 2026. Every other non-homepage page on the site with a referring domain, 21 articles, service pages, landing pages and portfolio pages, holds 24 referring domains combined. Page age and promotion were not controlled for.

The three largest are the UK SEO statistics page with 12, local SEO statistics with 8 and AI search statistics with 7.

## Which page types hold the most referring domains on this site? {% #page-types %}

Every page on sunnypatel.co.uk with at least one live referring domain was pulled and grouped by page type on 24 September 2026. Statistics-page counts use the union of the referring-domain lists for each URL variant of that page, pulled per URL and combined in Python so a domain linking to more than one variant is counted once. Other page types use per-page counts from Ahrefs' pages-by-backlinks report, summed per type; these are not separately checked for a domain repeating across two different pages of the same type.

